    text_len_codepoint_switch_2026-11-03, 0, "2026-11-07 owner TEXT migration / existing PR7429 and PR7436 authors, coordinated by Astra. Selected design PR7425 supersedes the old ONLY AFTER phase3 hold; docs follow-up PR7505 was superseded by merged PR7524 f880e13565cf18dbdad9a61ff562ddcf16ce92eb. Broad migration remains OPEN: PR7429 head796187cbb6e4176cb0bbe079c18a62d02b7ece79 has cross-receiver candidates; PR7436 headce6f71b408a8d0d0276c9a792de3bf14a5f34510 remains an unfinished C1 draft. Narrow query PR7539 does not complete this row."
    text_len_codepoint_switch_2026-11-03, 1, "Future admitted-runtime unblock: \"$SIMPLE_BIN\" test test/01_unit/lib/text/text_len_units_spec.spl --mode=interpreter after selected source integration. Dependency-gated additional command \"$SIMPLE_BIN\" test test/01_unit/compiler/mir/text_len_units_lowering_spec.spl --mode=interpreter requires that exact spec from pending PR7429 head796187cbb6e (Git object confirmed); it is NOT present in the current release base and is not runnable before dependency landing. Native/bootstrap parity and broader migration are NOT_RUN/unqualified; do not merge draft7436 or close this row from source inspection. Design doc/05_design/language/text/text_len_counts_characters_2026-11-07.md."

